{'symbol': 'UNH', 'date': '2023-01-26 09:00:00', 'title': 'UNITEDHEALTH GROUP INVESTS $10 MILLION IN NEW FUND, INVEST APPALACHIA, TO ADDRESS SOCIAL NEEDS AND ADVANCE ECONOMIC EQUITY', 'text': 'MINNETONKA, MINN.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--UNITEDHEALTH GROUP (NYSE: UNH) HAS COMMITTED $10 MILLION AS A LEAD INVESTOR IN THE FIRST ROUND OF THE INVEST APPALACHIA (IA) FUND, A REGIONAL INITIATIVE LAUNCHED TO ACCELERATE FUNDING IN COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT ACROSS APPALACHIAN COUNTIES IN KENTUCKY, NORTH CAROLINA, OHIO, TENNESSEE, VIRGINIA AND WEST VIRGINIA.'}